{"id":"18.08.Labstend","contentHtml":"<p><em>«Uchtech-Profi» — recognized leader in the CIS market for developing innovative educational products.</em></p>\n<p>My first serious job in the industry, which I <mark>got at age 19</mark> while being a college student. Here I went from a developer to <strong>independently leading projects</strong>, creating <code>3D/VR simulators</code> and directly collaborating with university professors.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Responsibilities and Achievements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Developed</strong> a wide range of <code>3D</code> and <code>VR</code> simulators for technical disciplines (metrology, fire safety, automation, etc.).</li>\n<li><strong>Collaborated with professors</strong>, turning their expertise into finished products.</li>\n<li><strong>Independently led projects</strong> from concept to final implementation.</li>\n<li><strong>Gained experience</strong> working in a large team, being the youngest specialist in the office.</li>\n<li><mark><strong>All simulators were internal products.</strong> The portfolio includes only those materials that were <strong>officially published by the company itself</strong>.</mark></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Challenge</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>The main challenge</strong> was \"translating\" deep academic knowledge from expert professors into the language of interactive simulations. <strong>I learned</strong> to ask the right questions and build an effective feedback loop. <strong>As a result</strong>, I grew from an executor to a specialist who acts as a bridge between the expert and the final product.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Legacy and Growth</h2>\n<p>This job taught me the <mark>ability to listen to an expert, ask the right questions, and turn complex knowledge into a clear interactive experience</mark>. I grew into a specialist trusted with independent project management and gained invaluable teamwork experience, which laid the foundation for my engineering discipline and communication skills.</p>\n","published":true,"title":"Uchtech-Profi","date":"2018-08 - 2022-01","type":"experience","tagsArray":["Unity","C#","HLSL","VR","PC","Web"],"heroVideo":["a_PNHbSz7eg"],"shortDescription":"<p>Worked at \"Uchtech-Profi\", a market leader in training simulators. Grew from a developer to <mark>independently leading projects</mark> in collaboration with professors.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://labstand.ru/"],"role":"unity-dev","projectIcon":"/images/projects/18.08.Labstend/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/18.08.Labstend/card.mp4?v=1765047023481","screenshots":[]}